<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · city</p><h1 class="enc-title">Kumbo</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Kumbo is a town in the North-West Region of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cameroon">Cameroon</a> and the capital of the Nso kingdom, whose Fon has his palace there. It became the seat of Nso after several moves of the capital and was occupied by German forces in the first years of the 20th century. Kumbo is now one of the largest towns of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cameroon-grassfields">Cameroon Grassfields</a> and a Catholic diocesan seat.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/kumbo.jpg" alt="Kumbo" width="320" height="240" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Tavmjong · CC BY-SA 3.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Kumbo_Cathedral.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
